### ==============================================================================
### Unit 2: Experiment 5 - Spring Boot REST API Design & Exception Handling
### Interactive HTTP Test Suite (Use with VS Code REST Client or Thunder Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customCorrelationId = corr-test-client-98765

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### HEALTH CHECK & ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### ASSIGNMENT 1 & CORE: UNIFORM RESPONSE STRUCTURE & HTTP METHODS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 GET All Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 1.2 GET Posts Filtered by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?category=Architecture
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 1.3 GET Posts with Search Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?search=Fielding
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 1.4 GET Post by ID (Existing Resource)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 1.5 POST Create New Post (Valid Input)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

{
  "title": "Decoupled Web Services with Spring Boot",
  "content": "This article discusses REST architectural constraints, stateless session management, and correlation IDs.",
  "author": "roy.fielding@uci.edu",
  "category": "Architecture"
}

### 1.6 PUT Update Existing Post by ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

{
  "title": "Understanding REST Architecture Principles (Updated 2nd Edition)",
  "content": "REST is a stateless, client-server architectural style providing uniform resource-based identifiers (URIs) and standard HTTP methods.",
  "author": "Dr. Roy Fielding",
  "category": "Architecture"
}

### 1.7 DELETE Post by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/4
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### ASSIGNMENT 2: BEAN VALIDATION TESTING (Invalid Inputs)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Invalid Input: Empty fields (Fails @NotBlank and @Size)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "",
  "author": "",
  "category": ""
}

### 2.2 Invalid Input: Title too short, Content too short, Invalid author format
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

{
  "title": "Hi",
  "content": "Short",
  "author": "@invalid!author#",
  "category": "Spring"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### ASSIGNMENT 4: GLOBAL EXCEPTION HANDLING (@RestControllerAdvice)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Resource Not Found (404) - ResourceNotFoundException
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/999999
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 4.2 Bad Request (400) - BadRequestException (Domain logic violation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/error/trigger-bad-request
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 4.3 Unhandled Internal Server Error (500) - Generic Exception Handler
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/error/trigger-500
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 4.4 Method Not Supported (405) - HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 4.5 Malformed JSON Body (400) - HttpMessageNotReadableException
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

{
  "title": "Missing closing bracket


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### ASSIGNMENTS 3 & 5: LOGGING FILTER & CORRELATION ID TRACING
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Fetch Recent Request Traces (Verify MDC Correlation IDs and Execution Times)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces
X-Correlation-ID: {{customCorrelationId}}

### 5.2 Clear Request Traces Cache
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/traces
